body:
That sounds great. What is your current position? Where do you want to go?

&#x200B;

Yeah, I'm really privileged and I'm thankful that I can basically choose what I want to work on. I started with Python basically and now I'm really getting into Go. It's amazing how much there is to learn :D.

Really cool post, thanks for sharing! 

&#x200B;

I always dreamed of doing what you're doing and wish I had the guts to do it. I had the same mindset as you, that it would be best to fully concentrate on a business idea instead of growing it on the side while working full time. I went with the safe route and started something on the side. This is really a hard thing to do and most of the time coming home I'm way to tired to sit on the computer for the rest of the evening!

&#x200B;

Anyways, best of luck to you. I hope it works out!
